| desc = Sprouts a ring of trees around a unit, damaging and trapping it in place and providing vision in a 400 radius.
}}
* Non-player-controlled units (i.e. [[lane creeps]]) do not try to path around these trees, but simply walk against them as if they are not there.
** Effectively causes them to get stuck, until they change directions (e.g. when being aggro'd), or until the trees expire.

