{{Splblocknotes
| name = Wrath of Nature
| desc = [[Spell Block]] sources proc on the first enemy unit neither affect the {{M|projectile}} bounce nor the {{M|spell damage}} component.
}}
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Wrath of Nature
| desc = Has to be {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted to proc the offensive [[Spell Duplication]] component.
}}
{{Splredirectnotes
| name = Wrath of Nature
| desc = Has to be {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted to proc the [[Spell Redirection]] component.
}}
{{Phylacterynotes
| name = Wrath of Nature
| desc = Procs [[Empower Spell]] regardless of its {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ability targeting type.
}}

 * Has the following targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** When unit-targeted, the affected enemy unit is the primary target.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
**** Grants [[caster vision]] only when unit-targeted.
** {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} {{Symbol|Target|Point}}
*** When ground-targeted or point-targeted, the ability automatically searches for the closest enemy unit within the Prophet's current {{M|vision}} radius.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|furion_sprout_entangle}}
*#* Issues an offensive stop command upon debuff application.
*#** This effectively cancels the affected enemy units' ability casts and interrupts current {{M|channeling}} abilities.
*#* Applies the following effects to affected enemy units for the entire debuff duration:
*#** {{M|Disarm}}
*#** {{M|Root}}
*#** {{M|True Sight}}
*#* {{Symbol|a|Up}}
*#** The debuff duration increases by {{ValueColor||{{#expr:({{#var:Wrath of Nature type2 value2 agh}}-{{#var:Wrath of Nature type2 value1 agh}})/({{#var:Wrath of Nature value3}}-1) round3}}|agh}} seconds per bounce ({{Code|n<sub>i</sub>}}), and is defined as:
*#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|DebuffDuration {{=}} Duration(MAX - MIN) / (n<sub>i</sub> - 1)}}
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} projectile can only affect the same enemy unit once per cast. The {{Code|n<sub>i</sub>}} instance spell damage is defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SpellDmg n<sub>i</sub> {{=}} {{#var:Wrath of Nature value4}} OR {{ValueColor||{{#var:Wrath of Nature value4 tal}}|tal|x}} × {{#var:Wrath of Nature value5}}^(n<sub>i</sub> - 1)}}
*#** Hence, it applies the max {{calc|v1*{{#var:Wrath of Nature value5}}^({{#var:Wrath of Nature value3}}-1) round1|v1={{#var:Wrath of Nature value4}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Wrath of Nature value5}}^({{#var:Wrath of Nature value3}}-1) round1|v1={{#var:Wrath of Nature value4 tal}}}}|10tal}}) spell damage value at the {{#expr:{{#var:Wrath of Nature basic1}}*({{#var:Wrath of Nature value3}}-1)}}<sup>th</sup> second upon damaging the {{#var:Wrath of Nature value3}}<sup>th</sup> unit and onward.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Vision|Base}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#** Checks for the closest visible enemy unit per bounce, within {{#var:Wrath of Nature basic1}}-second intervals, from the last affected enemy unit.
*#** The ability ends once there are no other valid targets within the bounce radius from the previous damage instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Wrath of Nature icon0}}
| desc = Damaging energy bounces around the map, striking enemies that are in vision starting with those closest to the cast point. Each enemy hit beyond the first adds damage, up to the maximum after 16 are hit.
}}

